        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\"><em>近战武器攻击：</em>命中</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">+4</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">，触及</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺，单一目标。命中：</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">9</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2d6+2</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）点钝击伤害外加</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">3</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1d6</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）强酸伤害。</span></p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20+4]]{+4} to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 9 ([[/damage 2d6 + 2 type=bludgeoning]]) damage plus 3 ([[/damage 1d6 type=acid]]) damage.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
